# CUPS installs its legacy image/raster helper alongside libcups. Qt's print
# support only links libcups, while linuxdeploy scans every ELF in the AppDir.
# Exclude the unused helper because the cached CUPS build requires libcrypt.so.2,
# which is not part of the Ubuntu 24.04 AppImage baseline.
lib/libcupsimage\.so(?:\..*)?
